          "locator": "prompt.md:2-3",
          "observation": "The prompt directs the agent to retry failed or incomplete lookups, spawn a researcher sub agent, and keep going until every row is complete."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes",
          "observation": "There is no maximum on steps, runtime, retries, or sub agents, and sub agents can spawn their own researchers."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes",
          "observation": "The nightly batch contains 40,000 rows and about 3 percent have malformed company names that never return a complete result, creating a persistent failure set."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes",
          "observation": "enrich.lookup is billed per call, the API key and monthly quota are shared with sales and marketing, and when the quota runs out their tools stop working until the next month."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes",
          "observation": "There is no spend alert on the enrichment account."
        }
